# Build-context trim for the game-server image (deploy/game-server/Dockerfile).
# Keep server/client/shared/addons and the wgnetstack built .so; drop heavy or
# non-runtime paths. The godot-cpp source tree is huge and never needed at
# runtime (only the prebuilt libwgnetstack .so under gdext/build is).
.git
.github
.godot
build
.scratch
docs
dashboard
tests
ci
infra
native/wgnetstack/gdext/godot-cpp
native/windows_launcher
**/*.log
